{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2023-04-12 14:33:00', 'title': 'ADP DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ROSELAND, N.J. , APRIL 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AUTOMATIC DATA PROCESSING, INC. (NASDAQ: ADP) HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.25 PER SHARE PAYABLE JULY 1, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 9, 2023.'}